        "-3",
        "1/3",
        "-1/3"
      ],
      "answer": "3",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "3"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "将两点代入y = kx + b得：5 = 2k + b，-4 = -k + b。两式相减得：5 - (-4) = (2k + b) - (-k + b)，即9 = 3k，解得k = 3。",
      "sourceDistanceStatus": "passed",
